<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="전체 흐름" id="DCoopbsKNQnbzPrSSz2n"><mxGraphModel dx="3283" dy="2769" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="5250" pageHeight="2970" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=44;fontColor=#17324D;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15&quot;&gt;2026 AUTO RACE  |  센서 → 인지 → 미션 → 우선순위 mux → /cmd_vel&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="54" width="5170" x="40" y="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=20;fontColor=#556477;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15&quot;&gt;단일 페이지 · 박스 = 워크스페이스 / 선 = 토픽명 · 메시지 타입 · 명령 번호가 작을수록 우선순위가 높음&lt;br&gt;센서 입력은 compressed camera와 /scan만 사용 · 미션 노드가 실행 중에만 후보 명령을 발행&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="60" width="5170" x="40" y="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sensor_ws" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F7FA;strokeColor=#607D8B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172D43;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;shadow=0;spacingTop=22;spacingLeft=24;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:32px&quot;&gt;sensor_ws&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;카메라·라이다 입력&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="560" width="500" x="70" y="1070" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sensor_camera" parent="sensor_ws" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#17324D;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=20;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:26px&quot;&gt;camera&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;/camera/color/image_raw/compressed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;sensor_msgs/msg/CompressedImage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="160" width="440" x="30" y="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sensor_lidar" parent="sensor_ws" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#17324D;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=20;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:26px&quot;&gt;lidar&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;/scan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;sensor_msgs/msg/LaserScan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="160" width="440" x="30" y="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="yolo_ws" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3EDFA;strokeColor=#8155A6;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172D43;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=22;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:32px&quot;&gt;yolo_ws&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;영상 → YOLO 인지&lt;br&gt;bump_sign / slow_sign / crosswalk_sign&lt;br&gt;LR_sign / signal / parking_sign&lt;br&gt;각 결과를 std_msgs/msg/Bool로 발행&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="270" width="480" x="930" y="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane_ws" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6E3;strokeColor=#B47713;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172D43;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=22;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:32px&quot;&gt;lane_ws&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;차선 유지 + 갈림길 A/B 주행&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;/current_lane&lt;/b&gt;: 0=좌측 / 1=우측 추종&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;기본값: 0(false), 좌측 추종&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;YOLO LR_sign: 갈림길 방향 판단&lt;br&gt;지그재그 조향 + 기본 속도 계산&lt;br&gt;3개 미션과 mux로 /mission/lane 발행&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="270" width="480" x="930" y="2300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="crosswalk_ws" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F7FA;strokeColor=#57708A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172D43;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=22;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:32px&quot;&gt;crosswalk_ws&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;우선순위 01 · 보행자 정지&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;/yolo/crosswalk_sign&lt;/b&gt; = true&lt;br&gt;YOLO 보행자 표지판 감지 Bool 수신&lt;br&gt;lane 조향 유지 · 속도만 0 / 재출발&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="245" width="550" x="2440" y="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="signal_ws" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F7FA;strokeColor=#57708A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172D43;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=22;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:32px&quot;&gt;signal_ws&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;우선순위 02 · 신호등 정지·발진&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;/yolo/signal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;false = red / true = green&lt;br&gt;lane 조향 유지 · 속도만 0 / 재출발&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="245" width="550" x="2440" y="530" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="parking_ws" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F7FA;strokeColor=#57708A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172D43;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=22;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:32px&quot;&gt;parking_ws&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;우선순위 03 · T자 주차&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;/yolo/parking_sign&lt;/b&gt; = true · 주차 표지판 감지&lt;br&gt;카메라 + LiDAR로 주차 / 정지 유지&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="245" width="550" x="2440" y="850" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cone_ws" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F7FA;strokeColor=#57708A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172D43;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=22;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:32px&quot;&gt;cone_ws&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;우선순위 04 · 라바콘 회피&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;LiDAR로 콘 배열 / 안쪽 경로 인식&lt;br&gt;회피 중인 경우에만 명령 발행&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="245" width="550" x="2440" y="1170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="objavoid_ws" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F7FA;strokeColor=#57708A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172D43;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=22;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:32px&quot;&gt;objavoid_ws&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;우선순위 05 · 정적 장애물 회피&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;LiDAR 장애물 + 카메라 차선&lt;br&gt;회피 후 발행 중단 → 차선 주행 복귀&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="245" width="550" x="2440" y="1490" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="slow_ws" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F7FA;strokeColor=#57708A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172D43;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=22;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:32px&quot;&gt;slow&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;우선순위 08 · 방지턱 + 지그재그 서행&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;/yolo/bump_sign · /yolo/slow_sign&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;bump: 방지턱 / slow: 지그재그 서행&lt;br&gt;lane 조향 유지 · 속도만 감속&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="245" width="550" x="2440" y="2450" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mux_ws" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E7F5ED;strokeColor=#238363;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172D43;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=22;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:32px&quot;&gt;mux_ws&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;우선순위 명령 선택 + 차량 출력&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;미션 command + /mission/lane 구독&lt;br&gt;유효한 미션 command 중 가장 작은 XX 선택&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;01&lt;/b&gt;  crosswalk · 보행자 정지&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;02&lt;/b&gt;  signal · 신호등&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;03&lt;/b&gt;  parking · 주차&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;04&lt;/b&gt;  cone · 라바콘&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;05&lt;/b&gt;  objavoid · 정적 장애물&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;08&lt;/b&gt;  slow · 방지턱 / 지그재그 서행&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DEFAULT&lt;/b&gt;  /mission/lane&lt;br&gt;갈림길도 lane 기본 명령에 포함&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;최종 차량 제어 출력&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;선택한 Ackermann 후보 → Twist 변환&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;/cmd_vel · geometry_msgs/msg/Twist&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;linear.x: m/s / angular.z: rad/s&lt;br&gt;후보 입력 timeout 시 정지 명령 발행&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="2480" width="590" x="3720" y="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="전체-edge-01" edge="1" parent="1" source="sensor_camera" style="edgeStyle=none;noEdgeStyle=1;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=1.9;fontColor=#1976D2;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=16;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;labelWidth=470;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=3;exitX=1;exitY=0.12;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryPerimeter=0;fontStyle=1;" target="yolo_ws" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;/camera/color/image_raw/compressed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700&quot;&gt; · sensor_msgs/msg/CompressedImage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="50" y="-367.1" as="offset"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="630" y="1209.2"/><mxPoint x="630" y="335"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="전체-edge-02" edge="1" parent="1" source="sensor_camera" style="edgeStyle=none;noEdgeStyle=1;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=1.9;fontColor=#1976D2;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=16;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;labelWidth=470;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=3;exitX=1;exitY=0.24;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryPerimeter=0;fontStyle=1;" target="lane_ws" value="&lt;div 